  <p id="c-taipingyulan-149-wangbaoming:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-taipingyulan-149-wangbaoming:p001:m0000" ref="f5r_lge_gw3">蕭子顯</persName>《齊書》曰：</p>
  <p id="c-taipingyulan-149-wangbaoming:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">又曰：<persName id="c-taipingyulan-149-wangbaoming:p002:m0003" ref="m9u_v4i_tk5">文安王皇后</persName>，諱<persName id="c-taipingyulan-149-wangbaoming:p002:m0010" ref="m9u_v4i_tk5">寶明</persName>，琅耶臨沂人。建元元年，爲南郡王妃。四年，爲皇太子妃，無寵。太子爲宮人制新麗衣裳及首飾，而後床帳陳古，釵鈐十餘枚。</p>
</text>
